blaze-chat

This component was copied from SGLang's Rust processor and adapted for Blaze.
Upstream: https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/tree/main/rust/sglang-processor
Upstream license: Apache-2.0 (the original license text is retained in LICENSE).

Local changes include crate renaming, workspace integration, chat rendering,
reasoning handling and tool-call parsing. Modified Rust files carry a change
notice. This component remains Apache-2.0; Blaze's MIT option does not apply
to the copied source.
